{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51667","headline":"谒宝塔回赐僧录 · 钱弘佐","name":"谒宝塔回赐僧录","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛日辉光最有灵，真身宝塔镇吴城。\n千寻独拔乾坤耸，八面齐含日月明。\n几曲朱栏瞻海浪，长时金铎振风声。\n祷祈只愿苍生泰，更仗高僧法供精。\n（以上《吴越钱氏传芳集》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}